WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 49411a7db976297a17fb5f2e027fcaff

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.060
Karibu tena. Umekuwa ukitumia kitanzi cha repeat

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.160
kwa muda sasa, na natumaini

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.640
unajisikia vizuri kukitumia. Sasa tutaangalia

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.500
kitu kinachohusiana na hicho ambacho ni

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:13.220
changamani kidogo zaidi. Hebu tuseme tunataka mstari

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:15.740
wa maua. Tunaweza kuandika kitu kama hiki.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.720
Tunaweka nafasi, tunapanda ua,

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.300
tunaongeza nafasi kwa 10, tunarudia,

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.560
na mwishowe tunapata mstari mzuri

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.640
wa maua uliopangwa vizuri. Lakini vipi ikiwa tunataka

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:30.240
gridi ya maua yenye mistari na safu? Labda

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:32.780
mistari minne yenye maua matano katika kila mstari.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.580
Simama kidogo, labda sitisha

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:38.640
video kwa sekunde moja, na ufikirie

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:42.380
jinsi unavyoweza kufanya hivi. Tuna

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:44.880
kitanzi kinachochora mstari mmoja wa maua.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:48.240
Unawezaje kukitumia kuchora mistari

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.660
minne? Au tunaweza kufanya nini ili kuchora

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.420
mistari minne? Sawa, natumaini umeshafikiria.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.360
Njia moja inaweza kuwa kunakili

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:00.680
na kubandika kitanzi hicho mara nne na kubadilisha

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:03.260
nafasi ya juu kwa kila kimoja. Hiyo

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:07.970
itafanya kazi. Itakuwa sawa. Lakini inarudia rudia, na

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:10.380
kuna njia bora. Tunajua kwamba msimbo

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:13.420
unaporudia rudia, tunaweza kutumia kitanzi

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:17.920
kurahisisha mambo. Kwa hiyo hapa tunaweza kutumia kitanzi kimoja

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:21.840
ndani ya kitanzi kingine. Kitanzi kimoja kwa

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:24.840
mistari na kingine kwa maua ya

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:28.080
mstari huo. Hebu tuanze kwa kuongeza kitanzi cha repeat

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.360
kuzunguka msimbo wetu uliopo ili

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.220
uone jinsi hii inavyokwenda. Na tutarudia

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:35.020
mara moja tu. Kwa hiyo tunamwambia Jiki

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:38.680
afanye kila kitu kilicho ndani ya mabano yaliyopinda ya nje mara moja.

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:41.920
Hivyo hii ina athari sawa kabisa na

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.220
kutokuwa na kitanzi hiki cha nje kabisa.

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:46.870
Tunamwambia Jiki arudie kitu mara moja, ambayo ni

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.440
sawa kabisa na kumwambia Jiki afanye

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:51.000
hivyo bila repeat. Lakini ninakuonyesha

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:53.000
hili ili uone kwamba hivi ndivyo msimbo

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:55.500
huu unavyofanya kazi. Ni msimbo halali na sahihi. Tuna

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:59.900
kitanzi kimoja ndani ya kitanzi kingine. Kwa hiyo sasa

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:02.960
nini kinatokea ikiwa tunabadilisha kitanzi hicho cha nje

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.520
kirudie mara mbili? Sasa Jiki atafanya

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:10.400
kile kitu kizima cha plant mara tano, mara mbili. Atapanda

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:14.460
maua 10. Lakini maua hayo yote yatakuwa

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.600
kwenye mstari mmoja. Kwa hiyo,

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:20.520
kama vile tunavyohitaji kusogeza nafasi

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:22.180
kutoka kushoto kwenda kulia kidogo kila mara,

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:26.240
baada ya kuchora kila mstari kamili, tunahitaji

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:28.660
pia kusogeza nafasi ya wima.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.540
Kwa hiyo tunafanyaje hilo? Basi,

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:35.480
tunaweza kuongeza variable ya nje kwa nafasi

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:39.970
ya juu, kuitumia katika kitendakazi chetu cha plant,

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.880
kisha kuiongeza kwa 10 baada ya kila mstari.

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:46.920
Kwa hiyo fikiria thamani inakuwa nini

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:50.480
kila wakati. Nafasi ya juu inaanza kwa 10.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:53.360
Mara tano za kwanza tunapopanda, inabaki

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:56.720
hivyo. Nafasi ya kushoto inaongezeka. Kisha

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:59.720
tunaongeza 10 nyingine kwake, kwenye hiyo

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:03.480
nafasi ya juu, na tunapanda maua mengine matano

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:07.120
chini kidogo. Tunairudisha nafasi ya kushoto

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:09.150
kwenye 10 tena, kisha

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:13.120
tunaiongeza tena kila mara. Na sasa

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:16.030
tunaweza kusema rudia hili mara nne, na

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:20.360
tutapata mistari minne ya maua matano.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:23.070
Jambo la muhimu kuelewa ni kwamba Jiki hukamilisha

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:26.160
kazi yote ya kitanzi cha ndani kabla

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:28.440
ya kurudi kwenye kitanzi cha nje.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:32.140
Hajirukii huku na huko. Anakamilisha kitanzi

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:34.130
cha ndani, kisha anaendelea na

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:37.660
hatua inayofuata ya kitanzi cha nje. Katika

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:39.520
hali hii, unaweza kufikiria

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.880
kitanzi cha nje kama kinachodhibiti vikundi au

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:44.720
mstari, na kitanzi cha ndani kama kinachodhibiti kila

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:47.049
kipengele katika kikundi hicho au kila kipengele

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:50.549
katika mstari huo. Kwa hiyo katika mfano wetu,

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:54.580
kitanzi cha nje kinaunda mistari minne, na kitanzi cha ndani

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:57.760
kinaweka mimea mitano, vipengele vitano katika kila kikundi.

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:02.100
Katika mazoezi yajayo, utatumia vitanzi ndani

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:05.520
ya vitanzi kujenga vitu. Mazoezi haya mapya

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:08.160
yatakupa vitendakazi vya kuchora kila kipande.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:10.160
Kazi yako ni kubaini tu

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.829
muundo sahihi wa vitanzi ili

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:16.029
vifanye kazi. Kila kitu katika mazoezi haya kimo

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.760
katika yale tuliyojadili hivi punde. Kwa hiyo

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:19.860
ukikwama, rejea video hii.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:22.160
Kila la heri, na tutaonana hapa tena

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:22.460
hivi karibuni.
